<h1 class="sm-heading wide">Sounds Of Australia</h1>

{#- The map comes first, as big as the window allows. #}
{% include "partials/sounds-of-map.njk" %}

<p class="standfirst">A travelling live-music video series documenting emerging Australian artists.</p>

<h2>About the series</h2>
<p>Sounds Of took a portable recording rig on the road to film emerging Australian artists playing live in the places that shaped them: lounge rooms, community halls, beaches and back sheds.</p>
<p>Every song is a single take, minimal edits, all on the go.</p>
<p>I produced, filmed, recorded and mixed each episode, and managed the series' YouTube and social channels.</p>

<h2>How it's made</h2>
<p>Everything fits in one car: two BMPCC 4Ks, a camcorder, a bag of microphones, a portable interface and a laptop. Songs were captured as multitracks on location, then mixed back through headphones using Reaper.</p>
